      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-04-11_WidnesExaminer_art0118" n="art0118">
        <head>GREAT SANKEY.</head>
        <p>GREAT SANKEY.</p>
        <p>Men's Service.--A Church of England Men's Society service was held in St. Mary's Church last Sunday afternoon. There was a good at- tendance of men. The preacher, the Rev. G. Stephen Jones, took as his text, "Ye are the body of Christ, and members in particular," and impressed on his hearers that this high privi- lege of being members of the body of Christ was theirs not because of their own worth, but be- cause in His free grace God saw them in and through Christ, and saw that by their corporate life they were capable of reflecting the image of His Son. There were doors opening in front of them that if they would only have the cour- age to go forward anti enter, God would do great things through them, and in proportion as they went forward in faith so would their power and influence increase What God had done through a body of men was well illustrated in the work of the twelve disciples, who were the first ingp's society. The tremendous responsibility of being the body of Christ was given to weak and sinful men • and women. because God saw them not as they were, but a y His grace they could become. •</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-04-11_WidnesExaminer_art0119" n="art0119">
        <head>FARMING FOR GIRL CONVICTS.</head>
        <p>FARMING FOR GIRL CONVICTS.</p>
        <p>A very interesting experiment is being tried on a farm colony near Philadelphia, United States, where .the whole cultivation is carried out by 400 girls lirho have been committed from the prisons of the State. Instead of going to a reformatory, these offenders, young in age, but old often in vice, are sent to serve their sen- tences on this farm. Under the supervision of trained women agriculturists they do all the farm work with the exception of , the heavy ploughing. They are girls aged from eight to. eighteen; their tools, especially made for thexa, are lighter than the usual farm implements. A very marked. improvement in health _a.nd general physique has been recorded in nearly every case, due to the helpful conditions and out-of-door life. 1 '‘ r: ,</p>
      </div>
